# R session
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# Regenerable outputs: only the canonical simulation map + report are committed;
# run_all.R and the cluster harness regenerate everything else into output/.
output/*
!output/compass_maps.rds
!output/compass_report.txt
# packaged saved inputs so Supplement Tables S5/S6 reproduce without the cluster
# shards (historical file names: s4_ feeds Table S5, s5_ feeds Table S6)
!output/s4_repetition_input.rds
!output/s5_diagnostics_input.rds
!output/S4_S5_PROVENANCE.md
!output/truths.rds
!output/TRUTHS_PROVENANCE.md
# saved applied-analysis results, so Tables S10-S11, Figure 1 and Figures S1-S2
# reproduce without the benchmark data (reviewed: no unit-level data and no per-unit
# vector; summary results only; see output/APPLIED_PROVENANCE.md, Unit-level content).
# output/lalonde_overlap.rds holds a per-unit propensity vector and must NEVER be
# negated here.
!output/rhc_factorial_fast.rds
!output/rhc_factorial_rf.rds
!output/rhc_overlap_diag.rds
!output/lalonde_estimates.rds
!output/APPLIED_PROVENANCE.md
# record of the clean-clone run_saved.R check
!output/CLEAN_CLONE_CHECK.md

# Benchmark data: fetched by data-raw/get_data.R; never committed (see README, Data).
# Directory-wide so a newly fetched file cannot be committed by `git add .`. Never add a
# negation for any file holding unit-level data or a per-unit vector of derived values.
/data/

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.blg

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Third-party reference code (Zivich & Breskin) is NOT redistributed; 03_verify_engine.R
# reads it from here only if the user saves it locally.
data/reference/
